Was KNOWNBUG (2026-09-22, found while reducing the gcc 16 failure of
cpp20_concept_conjunction_requires_params): "static assertion failed:
cv-differing lvalue references".  Fixed 2026-09-23: the conditional operator
over two lvalues differing in cv now yields an lvalue of the cv-combined type
([expr.cond]/4.1), which COND-RES / __common_ref rest on.
